      "en": "After ten days, the LORD’s word came to Jeremiah.",
      "ko": "십일 후에 여호와의 말씀이 예레미야에게 임하니",
      "source_text_hash": "bca3d1f3b7c629f43f88e24d5750e1c4b9e57498f39e0cf2da44b94e9a91e8c8",
      "translation_text_hash": "ea0836e670a9da75994c902fa62e9a43e997f95f4f784759ac5254734e6bcbad",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "십일 후에 여호와의 말씀이 예레미야에게 임하니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ea0836e670a9da75994c902fa62e9a43e997f95f4f784759ac5254734e6bcbad"
      ]
    },
