      "en": "then it will happen that the sword, which you fear, will overtake you there in the land of Egypt; and the famine, about which you are afraid, will follow close behind you there in Egypt; and you will die there.",
      "ko": "너희의 두려워하는 칼이 애굽 땅으로 따라가서 너희에게 미칠 것이요 너희의 두려워하는 기근이 애굽으로 급히 따라가서 너희에게 임하리니 너희가 거기서 죽을 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "9ad9b519f6cb26e26cfbf7da7306615c0cdaf4917927f32a2d411ed5ca3393ba",
      "translation_text_hash": "a90b3caf1ef23f09abce48c2de154c16bc57745608a55e7db11397af60f5db1f",
